Software: Apache License 2.0
----------------------------

All software in this repository is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. This covers the Lean library (Lean/), the certificate,
simulation, particle, and experiment code (code/), the build and audit
tooling (tools/), the runnable observer and repair-law software (model/),
the machine-readable schemas that the tooling validates
against (schemas/), and every other script, test suite, notebook, build
file, and requirements file in the repository, regardless of directory.

The full license text is at code/LICENSE, Lean/LICENSE, and tools/LICENSE
(identical copies), and at:

https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The Apache License 2.0 includes an express patent grant from each
contributor covering their contributions.

Papers, book, documentation, figures, and data: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
---------------------------------------------------------------

The authored non-software material, including the papers (paper/, extra/,
cosmology/, flagship/), the book (book/), the
documentation (docs/, README files, claims/), the figures (assets/), the
evidence data (evidence/), the generated ledgers and registers (tracking/),
the contribution records (contributions/), and the packaged particle data
(pdg_data/), is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.

The tabulated measurements in pdg_data/ are quoted from the Particle Data
Group and carry the upstream Particle Data Group terms. The grant above
applies to this repository's packaging of them: the file layout, the column
selection, and the provenance notes.

